    "body": "In https://github.com/jsdom/jsdom/pull/2921, @domenic mentioned some other possibilities, like making the activation behavior fully specified through an algorithm, with a possibly optional step of actually forwarding the click. This probably requires additional research. Chrome alone has special treatment for double clicks, moving focus to the labeled control, and mouse dragging actions. I'm sure Firefox has its own set of special behaviors.",
